OL,3,GNEWSA'I still saved #4,000' - mum calls
OL,4,Afor school holiday fine reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FA single mother has said she saved
OL,7,Fnearly #4,000 by taking her children on
OL,8,Fholiday during term-time, and has
OL,9,Fcalled for reform of school fines with
OL,10,Ffamilies stuck in a "price trap".
OL,12,FKashmir, from Willenhall, was fined
OL,13,Ftwice for family trips to Florida and
OL,14,FMexico, and said she had been made to
OL,15,Ffeel "like a criminal when I'm only
OL,16,Ftrying to do the best for my children".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
