OL,3,GNEWSA'I still saved #4,000' - mum calls
OL,4,Afor school holiday fine reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is not alone, BBC analysis found
OL,7,Fthat the number of fines issued to
OL,8,Ffamilies across the West Midlands for
OL,9,Ftaking children out of school during
OL,10,Fterm time has almost doubled in five
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,F"It's really difficult for working
OL,14,Ffamilies to go on holiday during
OL,15,Fofficial breaks, because the travel
OL,16,Findustry has a price trap that we're
OL,17,Fall in," the 47-year-old added.
